WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.275
Snow fell and fell.

2
00:00:07.276 --> 00:00:13.923
The farm turned white.

3
00:00:13.924 --> 00:00:23.599
The friends looked outside.

4
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:33.231
"Let's play!" said Dog.

5
00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:40.945
"Snow is so pretty!" said Cat.

6
00:00:40.946 --> 00:00:45.127
"Snow is so cold!" said Cow.

7
00:00:45.128 --> 00:00:53.084
"Snow is so white," said Pig.

8
00:00:53.085 --> 00:00:57.012
"I'll eat some!"

9
00:00:57.013 --> 00:01:00.563
"Let's slide down the hill," said Dog.

10
00:01:00.564 --> 00:01:03.519
"How?" asked Pig.

11
00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:08.510
"There's a sled in the barn," said Dog.

12
00:01:08.511 --> 00:01:14.121
"Let's get it!" said Pig.

13
00:01:14.122 --> 00:01:18.147
Dog pulled the sled.

14
00:01:18.148 --> 00:01:22.374
Then Pig pulled the sled.

15
00:01:22.375 --> 00:01:25.920
They pulled and pulled.

16
00:01:25.921 --> 00:01:31.766
They pulled it up the hill.

17
00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:39.138
The hill was very tall.

18
00:01:39.139 --> 00:01:46.150
It was a long way down.

19
00:01:46.151 --> 00:01:51.509
"Who will slide down the hill?" asked Dog.

20
00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:54.177
"Me!" said Pig.

21
00:01:54.178 --> 00:01:58.288
"Me!" said Cat.

22
00:01:58.289 --> 00:02:03.607
"Not me!" said Cow.

